    "source_text": "Mortgage Rates Hit Highest Level Since June 2025.\n\nMortgage rates just jumped to 6.87%, the highest level since June 2025. This increase of 6 basis points comes amid rising oil prices due to renewed hostilities in the Iran war. The rate has surged by over 30 basis points in just two months, making home buying more expensive for many. If you're considering a mortgage, now might be the time to act. If you want the link, just comment mortgage.",
